&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GAQ427R206&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1648&quot;&gt;While candidates in the listed location(s) are encouraged for this role, candidates in other locations will be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Drive the identification, engagement, and alignment of top-tier talent across corporate functions, with a primary focus on leadership hiring (Manager level through VP/Executive). In this role, you will act as a strategic partner to business leaders and recruiting partners, delivering a high-touch, consultative sourcing experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;We are looking for a true &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;utility player: &lt;/strong&gt;someone adaptable, highly versatile, and ready to pivot across functional areas, search levels, and talent initiatives as business priorities evolve. You will build robust, diverse pipelines that ensure we consistently raise the bar and scale leadership across the organization with intention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The impact you will have: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Corporate Sourcer supporting Leadership Hiring, you will partner directly with hiring managers, talent acquisition teams, and HR business partners to design and execute targeted search strategies. You will combine market intelligence, proactive outreach, and talent mapping to engage high-impact leaders across Manager, Director, and VP tiers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additionally, the Corporate Sourcer is responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Search Strategy &amp;amp; Market Mapping:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and execute comprehensive sourcing strategies to identify, map, and engage high-caliber talent across various corporate functions (e.g., HR, Finance, Legal, Marketing, Operations).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Versatility:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a flexible &quot;utility player&quot; across the TA team, comfortably shifting focus across different business areas, candidate levels, and emergent search priorities without missing a beat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pipeline Development &amp;amp; Diversity:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively cultivate deep, diverse talent networks to support current and future leadership needs while advancing our commitment to a diverse global workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Candidate Engagement &amp;amp; Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Gain the trust of passive prospective candidates, articulate our value proposition, and successfully convert them into active candidates across Manager, Director, and Executive levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Calibration &amp;amp; Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with hiring managers and recruiters to calibrate candidate profiles, share market research, and provide insights on industry talent trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Rigorous Screening:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct thorough initial assessments and screens to evaluate prospective candidates against functional needs, leadership capabilities, and our hiring bar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data &amp;amp; Search Progress:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and leverage sourcing metrics, market feedback, and candidate data to refine sourcing tactics and present updates during search reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt; Continually contribute to the team’s knowledge base by sharing competitive landscape mapping, market conditions, and target company research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years of specialized sourcing or talent acquisition experience, with a proven track record of identifying and engaging corporate talent from Manager up to VP level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Utility Player Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; High adaptability and comfort with ambiguity; ability to pivot seamlessly between different corporate functions, role types, and evolving business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Candidate Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build credibility and establish strong relationships with passive candidates across varying career stages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Conceptual Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to synthesize market data, map target organizations, and translate business needs into actionable sourcing strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Resourcefulness &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of being scrappy, creative, and proactive in surfacing hard-to-find talent within tight timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Organization &amp;amp; Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong prioritization skills to manage multiple leadership searches simultaneously in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Sourcing Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with modern sourcing tools, CRM platforms, ATS systems, and talent intelligence platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Range Transparency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Databricks is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. The pay range(s) for this role is listed below and represents the expected base salary range for non-commissionable roles or on-target earnings for commissionable roles.&amp;nbsp; Actual compensation packages are based on several factors that are unique to each candidate, including but not limited to job-related skills, depth of experience, relevant certifications and training, and specific work location. Based on the factors above, Databricks anticipated utilizing the full width of the range. The total compensation package for this position may also include eligibility for annual performance bonus, equity, and the benefits listed above. For more information regarding which range your location is in visit our page &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/sites/default/files/2024-08/us-pay-zone-mapping.pdf&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
